{"author_date": "2026-03-15T22:50:03Z", "author_login": "tapios", "commit_date": "2026-03-17T20:49:36Z", "committer_login": "tapios", "message": "Remove DiffEqBase/SciMLBase/KernelAbstractions dependencies; simplify API\n\nMajor refactor removing direct dependencies on DiffEqBase, SciMLBase, and\nKernelAbstractions. The package is now self-contained with local ODE types,\na local callback system, and cleaner type names.\n\nDependency changes:\n- Remove KernelAbstractions (replaced @kernel with plain loops)\n- Move DiffEqBase and SciMLBase from [deps] to [weakdeps]\n- Add backward-compat extension ext/ClimaTimeSteppersDiffEqExt.jl\n- Bump version to 0.9.0\n\nNew local types (src/problems.jl):\n- ODEProblem, SplitFunction, SplitODEProblem\n- IncrementingODEFunction, ODEFunction (with jac_prototype/Wfact/tgrad)\n- ODESolution (callable with nearest-time lookup)\n\nLocal callback system:\n- DiscreteCallback and CallbackSet defined in ClimaTimeSteppers\n- initialize_callbacks! and finalize_callbacks! helpers\n\nAPI simplification:\n- Rename DistributedODEAlgorithm -> TimeSteppingAlgorithm (alias kept)\n- Rename DistributedODEIntegrator -> TimeStepperIntegrator (alias kept)\n- Remove vestigial iip type parameter from OffsetODEFunction\n- Delete src/arbitrary_number_types.jl\n\nTest and docs cleanup:\n- Remove all DiffEqBase/SciMLBase references from test suite and docs\n- Update diffusion tutorial and index.md to use CTS API", "sha": "421b33edb04704b0f619937bc5f3dcdb2f8b2bf7"}
