{"author_date": "2026-07-03T06:06:45Z", "author_login": "tapios", "commit_date": "2026-07-03T06:06:45Z", "committer_login": "web-flow", "message": "v1-readiness: correctness fixes, API validation, and docs (#428)\n\n* v1-readiness correctness fixes, validation, and docs\n\nAdd preconditioner hook; cache LU factorization if possible; cleanup\nAudit-driven fixes hardening the public API before tagging v1. Each\nbehavioral fix ships with a regression test that fails when reverted.\n\nCorrectness:\n- WSRK multirate: clear stale inner tstops before each stage so the fast\n  tendency integrates over [t, t+c\u00b7dt] instead of the whole remaining span.\n- IMEX-SSPRK: route implicit stages through the shared solve_stage_implicit!\n  helper so the public initialize_imp! hook is honored (was ARK-only).\n- Newton: pass the 0-based iteration index to ConvergenceCondition (was\n  1-based), fixing MaximumErrorReduction / MinimumRateOfConvergence.\n- UpdateEveryN: fix reset-signal dispatch (bound the wrong type parameter,\n  leaving the reset feature dead).\n- EveryXSimulationTime: make tdir-aware so periodic callbacks fire under\n  reverse-time integration.\n- reinit!: recompute tdir from the new tspan.\n\nValidation / API hardening:\n- RosenbrockTableau: assert constant-diagonal \u0393 (other \u0393 silently wrong).\n- IMEXTableau / ExplicitTableau: assert c == row-sums(a) and b length.\n- UpdateEveryDt(dt::Real) value constructor (was a type-taking constructor);\n  deprecate the old form.\n- tableau(name) methods for IMEX/ERK names; export RosenbrockAlgorithm and add\n  a name-taking constructor.\n- step!(advance_to_tstop=true): guard empty tstops.\n- saveat: filter values outside the integration interval.\n- LineSearch: keep the lowest-residual iterate and never return a non-finite\n  one (no GPU-hostile logging).\n\nPublic surface / hygiene:\n- Re-export EveryXSimulationTime / EveryXSimulationSteps / EveryXWallTimeSeconds\n  at the top level.\n- has_T_exp: add an explicit _has_exp flag (false for limiter-only functions).\n- Compat: Julia 1.10 floor; tighten CUDA / ClimaComms / Krylov bounds.\n- Docstring accuracy, dead-code removal, and assorted nits.\n- Tests: state-coupled multirate convergence, stateful Newton convergence\n  conditions, SSP initialize_imp!, UpdateEveryN reset / UpdateEveryDt value,\n  reverse-time callbacks.\n\n* Formatting; preconditioner fix\n\n* Julia 1.12 needs looser tol in test", "sha": "c9f1225ac7d1565cd38763e191988db0aabc1136"}
{"author_date": "2026-07-02T23:48:04Z", "author_login": "sajjadazimi", "commit_date": "2026-07-03T17:08:48Z", "committer_login": "sajjadazimi", "message": "bugfix: post-Newton, if update_cache doesn't fire cache invoke cache_imp instead so the implicit-relevant cache still tracks the post-DSS solved state. Applied in both IMEX-ARK and IMEX-SSPRK.", "sha": "ff611e536769eb6ee9e9038da34040b4f7a2a0bb"}
{"author_date": "2026-07-03T21:41:39Z", "author_login": "sajjadazimi", "commit_date": "2026-07-03T21:41:39Z", "committer_login": "sajjadazimi", "message": "fix: pass float(dt) as dt\u03b3 proxy in benchmark ext: Wfact! and initialize_imp! receive dt\u03b3 (a plain float) in the real solver path; passing t/dt (ITime) through those hooks was breaking GPU codegen.", "sha": "2f0fcd6995b6d1c9f1c311e686bf156b22965655"}
{"author_date": "2026-07-08T21:30:47Z", "author_login": "sajjadazimi", "commit_date": "2026-07-09T18:44:44Z", "committer_login": "sajjadazimi", "message": "feat: add T_post_imp! post-Newton correction hook (optional). Evaluated on the Newton-solved stage state and folded into T_imp[i], so ARK order conditions are preserved.", "sha": "278d9db7e7ff4a1da2a466fead04f6f57a7f47a7"}
