{"author_date": "2026-08-10T21:13:57Z", "author_login": "tapios", "commit_date": "2026-08-10T21:13:57Z", "committer_login": "web-flow", "message": "Avoid scalar indexing in Krylov solver (#448)\n\n* use Krylov workspace adapter to keep workspace on GPU and improve GPU performance\n\n* Allow ClimaCore 0.14 in Project.toml compat\n\n* Formatting\n\n* Run the FieldVector Newton-Krylov tests in CI\n\nAdd ClimaCore and Krylov to the test dependencies and drop the\nBase.find_package(\"ClimaCore\") gate around the FieldVector testset. The\ngate never fired on CI, where ClimaCore was absent from the test\nenvironment, so the KrylovVectorAdapter path had no coverage; on machines\nwith ClimaCore in a shared environment it loaded a version outside the\ncompat bound instead.\n\nAlso refresh docs/Manifest.toml, which still pinned ClimaCore 0.14.51\nafter the docs compat moved to 0.15.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "sha": "ef18f31465ba101358df9b3d80055f0eea3db0c2"}
